%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6626c84bb700413428bce8fec5aff79d, type: 3}
  m_Name: LifeLineStart
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _description: 'player asks about jessi''s life outside of work, and jessi has nearly
    nothing to answer back other than her attempts at socializing.


    player wonders
    if social life is the most important matter to jessi, to which jessi agrees,
    slightly embarrassed. player how that''s been going, not really expecting any
    other answer other than "horribly"


'
  _sameOptionTarget: 0
  _lines:
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: I've never really paid attention to your life outside this place.
      I'm curious as to how you spend your free time.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Oh, why do you want to know? So you can bang me in the parking
      lot when I'm not busy?! You don't even hang out with me!!!
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Don't take it personally. You know why.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: It's not that, it's just...I get asked that literally all the
      damn time by drunkards trying to ask me out.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: '"Hurr durr hey baby what are you doing after this???'
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Oh you're just going straight home to rot on your bed and think
      about how much you wanna kill everybody???
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Well how would you like to have your back blown out while you
      do that heh how about that baby???"
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: At least once a week with that routine, so it's just a kneejerk
      reaction to not want to say anything...half the time they don't even look good
      enough to say shit like that.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: So MY BAD for getting defensive.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Of course she's managed to make it about herself in a way I DIDN'T
      ask for. Though I suppose it's useful information to gauge her reaction to
      my offer...
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: I apologize for whatever turmoils you here, but I believe I asked
      for your details on your life OUTSIDE of this establishment. Care to answer?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Yeah yeah, I'll get to it. Jeez, desperate much?
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Uhh, what I do in my free time...
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: I guess I just...talk...to people??
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: You talk to people.
  - _speaker: 1
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Well if you have a better answer why'd you even bother to ask??!!
  - _speaker: 0
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: Forgive me; I'm not trying to poke fun at you. I just wasn't expecting
      such a simple answer.
  - _speaker: 2
    _charSprite: {fileID: 0}
    _CG: {fileID: 0}
    _music: {fileID: 0}
    _shakeCamera: 0
    _triggerHeartbeat: 0
    _dialogueLine: placeholder line
  _playerReplyOptions:
  - _choiceType: 1
    _optionText: Give her some tips
  - _choiceType: 0
    _optionText: Pick apart her brain
  _npcReplies:
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2736e8f2826c6ea419a146426ea3fca4, type: 2}
  - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 53077af4f13396a448642201020ac121, type: 2}
  _gameEnd: 0
